  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0: aligned with Caveman core 1.5.0 and targets .NET 10. Now a real .NET tool: dotnet tool install --global Caveman.Mcp, command caveman-mcp. New tools semantic_cache_get, semantic_cache_set, semantic_cache_stats and semantic_cache_clear (algorithmic multilingual semantic cache for agents; numbers, file names and identifiers must match exactly). 1.4.5: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.5 - every compress/compress_batch call now keeps IPs, versions, dates and URLs verbatim, never corrupts JSON/code/SQL/YAML, and no longer inflates Chinese/Japanese output. 1.4.4: aligned with Caveman core 1.4.4. Two new tools: compress_sql (whitespace-safe SQL compression via CavemanSqlCompressor, with optional comment stripping and CCR value-folding) and idf_languages (lists the 56 shipped global-IDF tables and checks table/corpus size per ISO 639-3). route_content now routes SQL content to the SQL compressor (ContentType.Sql). 1.4.3 was a corrective re-publish of 1.4.2.",
